ummary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Minecraft 26.3, NeoForge 26.3.0.76, toms_storage-26.3-2.12.2\n\nIs it as intended that my connected chests only work up to fifteen chests high, and then the chests above that, which are placed just the same, do not connect?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/807/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/806","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/806/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/806/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/806/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/806","id":5912026442,"node_id":"I_kwDOD2xsYc8AAAABYGJdSg","number":806,"title":"Missing ingredients not marked in Tom's Storage Crafting Terminal (Fabric 26.3)","user":{"login":"sonja-maker16","id":344456287,"node_id":"U_kgDOFIf8Xw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/344456287?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16","html_url":"https://github.com/sonja-maker16","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonja-maker16/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-18T17:11:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:11:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Minecraft version: 26.3\nMod loader: Fabric\nTom's Storage version: 2.12.2\nJEI version: 31.16.0.84\n\nDescription:\n\nWhen I use the Crafting Terminal from Tom's Storage, clicking the plus button next to a recipe only inserts the ingredients available in my connected storage.\n\nMissing ingredients are not shown as red placeholders in the 3x3 crafting grid.\n\nIn a normal crafting table, JEI correctly shows missing ingredients in red. The JEI recipe viewer also correctly identifies missing ingredients.\n\nMy storage network works correctly.\n\nExpected behavior:\nMissing ingredients should be visibly marked in the Crafting Terminal, similar to the normal crafting table.\n\nActual behavior:\nOnly available ingredients are inserted. Missing ingredients remain unmarked.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/806/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/805","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/805/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/805/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/805/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/805","id":5854021375,"node_id":"I_kwDOD2xsYc8AAAABXO1G_w","number":805,"title":"Advanced Wireless Terminal does not open when equipped in Trinkets belt slot","user":{"login":"frbigblow","id":10241779,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjQxNzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10241779?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow","html_url":"https://github.com/frbigblow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frbigblow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-14T19:12:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T19:10:54Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T19:00:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi!\n\nI'm playing Minecraft 26.3 with Fabric, and I've encountered an issue with the Advanced Wireless Terminal when using it alongside Trinkets.\n\nThe terminal works correctly when placed in my inventory or hotbar: I can open it using the C keybind. However, when I equip the same item in the belt slot provided by Trinkets, pressing C no longer opens the terminal.\n\nSteps to reproduce\n\nInstall Tom's Simple Storage and Trinkets on Minecraft 26.3 Fabric.\n\nObtain an Advanced Wireless Terminal.\n\nPlace it in the inventory or hotbar and press C. The terminal opens correctly.\n\nEquip the terminal in the Trinkets belt slot.\n\nPress C again. Nothing happens.\n\nExpected behavior\n\nThe Advanced Wireless Terminal should open when equipped in the Trinkets belt slot, just as it does when held in the inventory or hotbar.\n\nActual behavior\n\nThe keybind does not work while the terminal is equipped in the belt slot.\n\n\nThanks for your work on the mod <3 !","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/805/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/804","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/804/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/804/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/804/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/804","id":5767403501,"node_id":"I_kwDOD2xsYc8AAAABV8OX7Q","number":804,"title":"[26.3] hard boot crash using REI (2.12.0 and 2.12.1)","user":{"login":"dsmtE","id":37016704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDE2NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37016704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE","html_url":"https://github.com/dsmtE","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsmtE/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-08T19:05:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T19:00:52Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T19:00:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi, love the mod but i hita hard crash on 26.3...\n\nMods used: MC 26.3 / Fabric Loader 0.19.5 / Tom's 2.12.0 and 2.12.1 (both tested,\nboth crash) / REI + DynamicFPS present / Java 25, singleplayer.\n\nWhat happens: game crashes during init, before the title screen, every boot\nas long as Tom's Storage and REI are installed together.\n\nWhat I found inside both jars: fabric.mod.json declares rei_client, emi,\njei_mod_plugin and jade entrypoints, but the jars ship none of those\npackages (no com/tom/storagemod/rei/ anywhere). So REI fails its plugin\nload with:\n\nCaused by: java.lang.ClassNotFoundException:\ncom.tom.storagemod.rei.REIPlugin (entrypoint 'rei_client')\n\nREI then opens its error screen during game init, which trips a second\ncrash in DynamicFPS's renderFrame wrapper (framerateLimitTracker is still\nnull this early), full trace available if useful, happy to attach the crash report and log.\n\nMaybe Related: #799 and #793 \n\nbut REI isn't covered by #799, so the crash persists even if that merges.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/803","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/803/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/803/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/803/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/803","id":5716884506,"node_id":"I_kwDOD2xsYc8AAAABVMC8Gg","number":803,"title":"Items can be added as filters which aren't filters","user":{"login":"dkarvik","id":6136282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzYyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6136282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik","html_url":"https://github.com/dkarvik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkarvik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:12:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T18:12:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"...and then those items can't be removed.\n\nIn #394 the reporter noted that they'd put a filter into the filter slot from another mod.  I did this not realising I hadn't installed [Create: Filters Anywhere](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-filters-anywhere) and then realised:\n\n1. I couldn't remove the item\n2. That it wasn't functional which I assumed it was because it was accepted","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/803/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/803/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/801","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/801/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/801/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/801/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/801","id":5713885817,"node_id":"I_kwDOD2xsYc8AAAABVJL6eQ","number":801,"title":"Inventory Proxy does not have #minecraft:mineable/axe tag","user":{"login":"Nummer42O","id":63714738,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE0NzM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63714738?v=4","gravatar_id":"